  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Details :</strong> ,</span> has released the marksheet for the State/ Upper Subordinate Services 2024, This recruitment was released for 220 posts. The applications for UPPSC Mains Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 07 March 2025 to 24 March 2025. The Interview was held on 16 February 2026 to 20 March 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their UPPSC PCS Marksheet 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission (UPPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPPSC PCS Marksheet 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPPSC Pre 2024 Advt No. : A-1/E-1/2024</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Date Starting Date : <strong>01 January 2024</strong><br>\n</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>29 January 2024</strong><br>\n</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date :<strong> 29 January 2024</strong><br>\n</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 1