er;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Combined Upper Subordinate Services UPPSC Pre 2024</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">220 Post</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPPSC Pre 2024 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from any Recognized University in India will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPPSC Pre 2024 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Pre Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Interview (Viva-Voce)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Instruction for Downloading UPPSC PSC Marksheet 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then click on the Download Marksheet link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candi